The '''Ghost of Baking Specialist''' is an [[NPC]] that only appears as a {{Legendary}} [[Garden Visitor]] on {{zone|The Garden}}. They require {{Skill|Garden|7}} unlocked to visit, as well as talking to {{NPCSprite|Baker}} at least once. '''Ghost of Baking Specialist''' only visits during the [[Spooky Festival]].

